{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":131,"wording":"[Blademistress]","event":"named","holder-quote":"The [Blademistress of Ancients], Zeladona, who had been so old she had been literally turning to dust, was the young woman who had first mastered all these arts. She appeared as she wanted to be, and the radiance of her soul might have eclipsed even Khelta’s. A bit.","id":"e0d483f5-59c7-5341-a14d-08816007922f"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":163,"wording":"[Blademistress]","event":"named","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"Khelta","holder-quote":"“What did you mean, Great Zeladona, about influencing the real world?”","id":"b948c958-a1e5-5d7b-9eec-5b7ce9b55d8a"}
